{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061645/block/singleImage/3255866/df/1631530293_xw_0.JPG?updatedAt=1793627309\"/><figcaption>觀塘裁判法院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>警方於上月29日先後接獲兩名分別26歲，以及34歲女子報案，指懷疑於同日被一名男子在觀塘開源道非禮。案件交由觀塘警區刑事調查隊第一隊跟進。</p><p>警方經翻查大量閉路電視片段後迅速鎖定疑犯，遂於上月31日凌晨在天水圍天慈邨拘捕一名43歲本地男子。被捕男子被控兩項「猥褻侵犯」罪，已於今日(2日)在觀塘裁判法院提堂。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:30.105579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:48:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:20.089020+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:23.822123+00:00","content_hash":"31af2871e694553da28b9df4ebd2c53543d6d1f40a0d8b8bb71746dffb4e6f2f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:30.105579+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}